# Copy to .env and adjust. Read by Vite at build/dev time, not by the Go server.

# ---- Google Maps (optional) ----
# Powers the embedded map on a course's detail page. Leave blank to hide the
# map; address and phone number stay clickable either way.
#
# Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials, enable the
# "Maps Embed API" for it, and restrict it to your site's domain(s) — this key
# ships in the built frontend, so it is visible to anyone who loads the app.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
